If you look at the .tiff file in GCOS you will see that there is a 
'checkerboard' of probes that go completely around the outside of the 
chip. These are used by the affy software to align the scanner, and are 
scanned, but are neither QC nor expression measuring probes. I believe 
these make up most of your missing probes.

